   "label": "II",
   "title": "Basic knowledge of the following concepts:",
   "body": "Vadi, Samvadi, Anuvadi, Vivadi,Uttarang, Puravang, Aroh, Avroh, Pakad, Thata(Mela) Jati- Audav,Shadav, Sampurna and its varieties.",
   "sourcePage": 2
  },
  {
   "ref": "cn_2dc2526b3a4e4d4ea72fcfe1b5d5a37f",
   "parentRef": "cn_78d9bed48a9242e4a1cf4cea41b79612",
   "kind": "UNIT",
   "label": "III",
   "title": "Laya & Tala",
   "body": "Laya – Vilambit,Madhya, Drut Layakari- Dagun, Tigun, Chaugun, Chegun, Tala, Matra, Tali, Khali, Sam, Vibhag, Avartan, Knowledge of prominent Talas: Teental,Ektala, Dadra, Keharwa, Jhaptala, Rupak, Adi, Saptala, Chaputala, Rupakam.",
   "sourcePage": 2
  },
  {
